{"id":"n62661-4-7","stage":1,"title":"가득 · 充满","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62661-4-7-1","ko":"여자 친구가 제 생일에 직접 목도리를 떠서 줬어요.","zh":"我女朋友在我生日那天亲手为我织了条围巾送给我。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여자","meaning":"女性（여자 친구 合指“女朋友”）","explanation":"여자：女性（여자 친구 合指“女朋友”）","readings":[{"term":"여자","audio":"/audio/3109db6ce062c8633018.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27369","senseId":"3","lemma":"여자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"친구가","meaning":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","explanation":"친구：朋友，好友， 友人，故旧；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29742","senseId":"1","lemma":"친구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"제","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"생일에","meaning":"生日，生辰","explanation":"생일：生日，生辰；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"생일","audio":"/audio/a2b4cce280c34b80d474.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63220","senseId":"1","lemma":"생일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"직접","meaning":"亲手，亲自","explanation":"직접：亲手，亲自","readings":[{"term":"직접","audio":"/audio/20c483bdda9706e41f07.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71493","senseId":"1","lemma":"직접","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"목도리를","meaning":"围巾","explanation":"목도리：围巾；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"목도리","audio":"/audio/634f23a72357e4022c83.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55854","senseId":"1","lemma":"목도리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"떠서","meaning":"织，打","explanation":"뜨다：织，打；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"뜨다","audio":"/audio/83c29e672f4ac6fe6fc4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"53951","senseId":"1","lemma":"뜨다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"줬어요.","meaning":"给予，给","explanation":"주다：给予，给；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82136","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"3109db6ce062c863","term":"여자","zh":"女性（여자 친구 合指“女朋友”）","audio":"/audio/3109db6ce062c8633018.mp3","entryId":"27369","definition":"女性（여자 친구 合指“女朋友”）","pronunciation":["여자"]},{"id":"1202aff936337891","term":"친구","zh":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3","entryId":"29742","definition":"关系亲近而交往甚密的人。","pronunciation":["친구"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"a2b4cce280c34b80","term":"생일","zh":"生日，生辰","audio":"/audio/a2b4cce280c34b80d474.mp3","entryId":"63220","definition":"人出生的日子。","pronunciation":["생일"]},{"id":"20c483bdda9706e4","term":"직접","zh":"亲手，亲自","audio":"/audio/20c483bdda9706e41f07.mp3","entryId":"71493","definition":"没有人或物介入在中间而直接。","pronunciation":["직쩝"]},{"id":"634f23a72357e402","term":"목도리","zh":"围巾","audio":"/audio/634f23a72357e4022c83.mp3","entryId":"55854","definition":"为了抵御寒冷而围在脖子上的用品。","pronunciation":["목또리"]},{"id":"83c29e672f4ac6fe","term":"뜨다","zh":"织，打","audio":"/audio/83c29e672f4ac6fe6fc4.mp3","entryId":"53951","definition":"用线或绳等编做成衣服或网。","pronunciation":["뜨다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"给予，给","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"82136","definition":"把东西等递给别人，让别人拥有或使用。","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/96fa5bef105138035f27.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62661-4-7-2","ko":"정성이 가득 담긴 선물이네요.","zh":"这礼物真是饱含了满满的心意啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"정성이","meaning":"精诚，诚心","explanation":"정성：精诚，诚心；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"정성","audio":"/audio/476a1997460efa83af06.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31756","senseId":"1","lemma":"정성","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가득","meaning":"充满，满满地","explanation":"가득：充满，满满地","readings":[{"term":"가득","audio":"/audio/260476e01310cd163341.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62661","senseId":"4","lemma":"가득","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"담긴","meaning":"含，内含，带有","explanation":"담기다：含，内含，带有；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"담기다","audio":"/audio/486c8400893690b15fec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66323","senseId":"2","lemma":"담기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"선물이네요.","meaning":"礼物","explanation":"선물：礼物；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"선물","audio":"/audio/807cae1b570857696082.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36685","senseId":"1","lemma":"선물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"476a1997460efa83","term":"정성","zh":"精诚，诚心","audio":"/audio/476a1997460efa83af06.mp3","entryId":"31756","definition":"尽全部力量的真诚的心意。","pronunciation":["정성"]},{"id":"260476e01310cd16","term":"가득","zh":"充满，满满地","audio":"/audio/260476e01310cd163341.mp3","entryId":"62661","definition":"某种感情或想法非常强烈的样子。","pronunciation":["가득"]},{"id":"486c8400893690b1","term":"담기다","zh":"含，内含，带有","audio":"/audio/486c8400893690b15fec.mp3","entryId":"66323","definition":"某些内容、想法包含或体现在画作、文字、话语或表情上等。","pronunciation":["담기다"]},{"id":"807cae1b57085769","term":"선물","zh":"礼物","audio":"/audio/807cae1b570857696082.mp3","entryId":"36685","definition":"为表达谢意或祝贺某事而把东西送给别人；或指该东西。","pronunciation":["선ː물"]}],"audio":"/audio/e6d178a5ec41711d09df.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.457,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62661","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"4","sourceLevel":"초급","day":44,"sequenceScore":1.9705,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["这礼物真是饱含了满满的心意啊。","咦？好像算错了啊？","我女朋友在我生日那天亲手为我织了条围巾送给我。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这礼物真是饱含了满满的心意啊。","我女朋友在我生日那天亲手为我织了条围巾送给我。","咦？好像算错了啊？"],"answer":0}]}
